			<div class="entry-content" itemprop="mainContentOfPage">

				
				<div data-id="2" class="mfn-builder-content mfn-default-content-buider"><section class="section mcb-section mfn-default-section mcb-section-ungugwiuf"   style="" ><div class="mcb-background-overlay"></div><div class="section_wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps mcb-section-inner mcb-section-inner-ungugwiuf"><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-rdgbcj84 one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-rdgbcj84 mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-6i4wcqkow four-fifth tablet-four-fifth laptop-four-fifth mobile-one mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="four-fifth" data-laptop-col="laptop-four-fifth" data-tablet-col="tablet-four-fifth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-6i4wcqkow mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-0w7ql22ia one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_column animate vb-item" style="" data-anim-type="fadeInRight"><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-0w7ql22ia mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style=""><h2 style="text-align: left;">Making AI Systems Secure for All</h2>
<p>The Coalition for Secure AI (CoSAI) is an open ecosystem of AI and security experts from industry leading organizations dedicated to sharing best practices for secure AI deployment and collaborating on AI security research and product development. </p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-439b6o5du one-fifth tablet-one-fifth laptop-one-fifth mobile-one mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one-fifth" data-laptop-col="laptop-one-fifth" data-tablet-col="tablet-one-fifth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-439b6o5du mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-12l3owhfa three-fourth laptop-three-fourth tablet-three-fourth mobile-one column_image vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-12l3owhfa mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame image_item no_link scale-with-grid element_classes alignnone no_border mfn-img-box" ><div class="image_wrapper"><img width="293" height="300" src="https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/shield-293x300.webp" class="scale-with-grid" alt="" style="" decoding="async" srcset="https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/shield-293x300.webp 293w, https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/shield-73x75.webp 73w, https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/shield-480x491.webp 480w, https://www.coalitionforsecureai.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/shield.webp 600w" sizes="(max-width:767px) 293px, 293px" /></div></div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-jxachtmj one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-jxachtmj mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-77278b5bd one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_visual vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-77278b5bd mcb-item-visual-inner"><div class="mfn-visualeditor-content mfn-inline-editor"><h2>What is CoSAI?</h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Security requires collective action and the best way to secure AI is with AI. To participate safely in the digital ecosystem — and secure it for everyone — individuals, developers and companies alike need to adopt common security standards and best practices. AI is no exception. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The <strong>Coalition for Secure AI (CoSAI)</strong> is actively </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">addressing this challenge by fostering a collaborative ecosystem of diverse stakeholders to invest in AI security research collectively, share security expertise and best practices, and build technical open-source solutions and methodologies </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">for secure AI development and deployment. </span></p></div></div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-rqder4ql one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_visual vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-rqder4ql mcb-item-visual-inner"><div class="mfn-visualeditor-content mfn-inline-editor"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Since its launch, CoSAI has made significant strides in strengthening AI security through collaboration with industry and academia across several critical workstreams:</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-t4ivdmv8 one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-t4ivdmv8 mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-grvcp45p one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_feature_list vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-grvcp45p mcb-item-feature_list-inner"><div class="feature_list" data-col="2"><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/cosai-oasis/ws1-supply-chain" ><span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-box-open" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p>Software Supply Chain Security for AI Systems</p></a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/cosai-oasis/ws2-defenders" ><span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-check-double" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p>Preparing Defenders for a Changing Security Landscape</p></a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/cosai-oasis/ws3-ai-risk-governance" ><span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-file-contract" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p>AI Security Risk Governance</p></a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/cosai-oasis/ws4-secure-design-agentic-systems" ><span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p>Secure Design Patterns for Agentic Systems</p></a></li>
</ul><ul class="fl-content"></ul></div>
</div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-r8y3w1ee one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-r8y3w1ee mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-qi1qh4z one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_visual vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-qi1qh4z mcb-item-visual-inner"><div class="mfn-visualeditor-content mfn-inline-editor"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">CoSAI operates under </span><a href="https://www.oasis-open.org/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">OASIS Open</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">,</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> the international standards and open source consortium.</span></p>
<p> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section mcb-section mfn-default-section mcb-section-xhvkfw9r" id="homepage-news"  style="" ><div class="mcb-background-overlay"></div><div class="section_wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps mcb-section-inner mcb-section-inner-xhvkfw9r"><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-rrhr3u1p one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-rrhr3u1p mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-kw3g74bm one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_heading vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-kw3g74bm mcb-item-heading-inner"><h2 class="title">Latest News & Events</h2></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section mcb-section mfn-default-section mcb-section-2d625eb8f mfn-looped-items" id="homepage-news"  style="" ><div class="mcb-background-overlay"></div><div class="section_wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps mcb-section-inner mcb-section-inner-2d625eb8f"><div  class="mfn-queryloop-item-wrapper mfn-ql-item-default" data-post="1804"><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-0cc5890a2 one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""   ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-0cc5890a2 mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-pv01zp6 one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_image vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-pv01zp6 mcb-item-image-inner"><div class="image_frame image_item scale-with-grid element_classes alignnone stretch no_border mfn-img-box"  role=